    {
      "title": "How to use this skill",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Confirm the audience is the end user, not the developer/integrator.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#how-to-use-this-skill",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Identify the surface. Public changelog feed / monthly digest email / in-product \"What's New\" panel?",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#how-to-use-this-skill",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Group by user benefit, not by file tree.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#how-to-use-this-skill",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Lead with the outcome, not the mechanism.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#how-to-use-this-skill",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Decide on visual treatment. Major UI changes get a screenshot or GIF.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#how-to-use-this-skill",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Decide on version-number visibility.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#how-to-use-this-skill",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Benefit-led language",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Replace internal nouns with user verbs.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#3-benefit-led-language",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Quantify when honest. \"3x faster\" is honest if measured.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#3-benefit-led-language",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Cut entries with no user-visible effect.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#3-benefit-led-language",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Name the bug by the symptom, not the cause.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#3-benefit-led-language",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep one sentence per atom.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#3-benefit-led-language",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Visuals — when, where, what",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Image craft checklist:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#4-visuals-when-where-what",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Real product data wherever the user's eye lands.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#4-visuals-when-where-what",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Dark mode if your product has dark mode.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#4-visuals-when-where-what",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Crop tightly.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#4-visuals-when-where-what",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Alt text describes the change, not the chrome.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#4-visuals-when-where-what",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "GIFs: under 5 MB, autoplay-on, loop.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#4-visuals-when-where-what",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Version numbers — hide, downplay, or omit",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Linear, Vercel, GitHub, Notion: no version numbers in the user changelog. The date is the version.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#5-version-numbers-hide-downplay-or-omit",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The version-number-only changelog. \"v1.42.0 - bug fixes and improvements.\" This is not a changelog.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The \"we're excited to announce\" opener. Cut. Open with the change.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The commit-log dump. Pasting git log --oneline into a webpage.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The \"improved performance\" non-entry. Either quantify it or omit it.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The screenshot of nothing. Always shoot with realistic data.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The \"internal upgrade\" entry. \"We upgraded our database to version 16.\" The user does not care.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/changelogs-for-humans/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
